{
  "annotations": {"list": []},
  "description": "Starter dashboard for MySQL native component_telemetry delivered through OpenTelemetry to Prometheus. Metric availability follows the enabled MySQL meter groups.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "MySQL native OpenTelemetry",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "This dashboard monitors MySQL native `component_telemetry` through OTLP. **Current server telemetry configuration:** metrics `ON`, traces `ON`, logs `ON`, and query text in traces `ON`. Query text is exported on statement spans as `mysql.sql_text` and can contain sensitive values; set `telemetry.query_text_enabled=OFF` when that is not acceptable. Use the metric inventory panel to discover every metric currently exported by this instance."}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "Connected threads",
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "threads_connected{service_name=\"mysqld\"}"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 100}, {"color": "red", "value": 500}]}, "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "Maximum used connections",
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "max_used_connections{service_name=\"mysqld\"}"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "SQL statements executed (cumulative)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "questions_total{service_name=\"mysqld\"}"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "DML commands (cumulative)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum({__name__=~\"(insert|update|delete|replace)_total\", service_name=\"mysqld\"})"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "Connections and SQL workload",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 11},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "threads_connected{service_name=\"mysqld\"}", "legendFormat": "connected threads"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "rate(questions_total{service_name=\"mysqld\"}[$__rate_interval])", "legendFormat": "SQL statements / sec"},
        {"refId": "C", "expr": "rate({__name__=~\"(insert|update|delete|replace)_total\", service_name=\"mysqld\"}[$__rate_interval])", "legendFormat": "{{__name__}} / sec"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "none"}, "legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}}
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "Top exported MySQL metric values",
      "description": "Shows up to 20 native MySQL metric series. Use the metric inventory below to discover the exact names emitted by this server and its enabled meter groups.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 11},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "topk(20, {service_name=\"mysqld\"})", "legendFormat": "{{__name__}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "none"}, "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}}
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "INSERT commands (cumulative)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 20},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "insert_total{service_name=\"mysqld\"}"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "UPDATE commands (cumulative)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 20},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "update_total{service_name=\"mysqld\"}"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "DELETE commands (cumulative)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 20},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "delete_total{service_name=\"mysqld\"}"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Workload counters",
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 20},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "**SQL executions** uses the MySQL `Questions` status counter.\n\n**DML** is `INSERT + UPDATE + DELETE + REPLACE`.\n\nAll workload cards are cumulative counters since the MySQL server started. The workload chart displays rates per second.\n\nThese command metrics require the `mysql.stats.com` meter. Its Prometheus names are `insert_total`, `update_total`, `delete_total`, and `replace_total`—without a `com_` prefix."}
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "title": "Exported MySQL metric inventory",
      "description": "One row per metric name currently received for this MySQL server. Use it to validate metric availability and create further panels.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "count by (__name__) ({service_name=\"mysqld\"})", "format": "table", "instant": true}],
      "options": {"showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm", "footer": {"show": false}},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {"type": "tempo", "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"},
      "title": "MySQL traces (latest 20; open a trace for SQL text)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 39},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "queryType": "traceql", "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"mysqld\" }", "limit": 20, "spss": 3, "tableType": "traces"}],
      "options": {"showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm", "footer": {"show": false}}
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"},
      "title": "MySQL native logs",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 39},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "{service_name=~\".*mysql.*\"}"}],
      "options": {"showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false, "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none", "sortOrder": "Descending"}
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Query-text telemetry",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 49},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "`telemetry.query_text_enabled = ON` adds the `mysql.sql_text` attribute to MySQL `stmt` spans in Tempo. The panel below lists only statement traces carrying that attribute. Open a Trace ID, select the `stmt` span, and view **Attributes → mysql.sql_text**.\n\n**Security:** this is the full SQL text submitted to MySQL and may include literal values. Give Tempo/Grafana access only to authorised users; turn the setting off if query text must not leave the server."}
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {"type": "tempo", "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"},
      "title": "Statement traces with query text (latest 20)",
      "description": "Shows only MySQL statement traces that include the mysql.sql_text span attribute. Open a trace to inspect the attribute value.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 53},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "queryType": "traceql", "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"mysqld\" && span.mysql.sql_text != nil }", "limit": 20, "spss": 3, "tableType": "traces"}],
      "options": {"showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm", "footer": {"show": false}}
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "tags": ["mysql", "opentelemetry", "native-telemetry"],
  "templating": {"list": [
    {"name": "DS_PROMETHEUS", "type": "datasource", "label": "Metrics datasource", "query": "prometheus", "current": {"selected": false, "text": "Prometheus", "value": "Prometheus"}},
    {"name": "DS_TEMPO", "type": "datasource", "label": "Traces datasource", "query": "tempo", "current": {"selected": false, "text": "Tempo", "value": "Tempo"}},
    {"name": "DS_LOKI", "type": "datasource", "label": "Logs datasource", "query": "loki", "current": {"selected": false, "text": "Loki", "value": "Loki"}}
  ]},
  "time": {"from": "now-1h", "to": "now"},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "MySQL Native OpenTelemetry",
  "uid": "mysql-native-otel",
  "version": 1
}
